            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "[Please download the \"README.txt\" file for instructions]\r\n\r\nThis dataset contains slides (in JPG format) from topics related to engineering and science.\r\n977,605 slides (from 31,923 slide decks) were collected from Slideshare using their API.\r\nThis dataset was used for training parameters of retrieval systems which indexed lecture videos.",
